    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH2b1585-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">To accept five thousand Wú (吳) courtesans</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, is the same as the errors of Hào (晧).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">The enfeoffment of women</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, brought chaos to the Six States;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">like posthumously bestowing a title on one's maternal great-grandmother</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, it violates the ancient Way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">All these improper matters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, are recorded in the previous book</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, and indeed they tarnish his brilliant plans.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">The historian dares not conceal them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-12a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">○ *Yù Lǎn* (御覽) 96.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">"Biàn Zōng Lùn" (辨宗論)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">"Biàn Zōng Lùn" (辨宗論)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">The various Daoist priests who traveled with me</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, all studied the Way of the mind and spirit</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, seeking understanding beyond words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">I, resting my head due to illness and having little to do</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, have quite a few leisure days</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, so I will briefly express the meaning of the origin</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, hoping to settle the understanding of seeking the source.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">The theory of the Buddhists</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">is that, although the Way of the Sage is distant</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, accumulated learning can reach it</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">; when accumulation is exhausted, wisdom arises</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">, it should not be gradual enlightenment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:04:45.782+09:00">The theory of the Confucians</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">The Sacred Way is profound and subtle;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">though close to Yán Hui's sagacity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">it cannot be fully comprehended in its entirety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and its principles ultimately converge to a single extreme.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">There is a Daoist with a new discourse who believes:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">That stillness and illumination are subtle and profound,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">not admitting of stages;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">that accumulated learning is boundless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">so why cut oneself off?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">Now, we discard the gradual enlightenment of the Śākyas,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and take their ability to attain the goal;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">we discard the approximate understanding of the Confucians,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and take their ultimate unity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">Ultimate unity is different from gradual enlightenment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and the ability to attain is not approximate understanding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">Therefore, though the principles they reject</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">are in agreement with what we each take,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">they are far removed from both Confucius and the Śākyas.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">I consider the words of the two discourses on saving beings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">the tenets of the Daoists,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and the doctrines of those who have attained understanding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">and dare to presume to offer a compromise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">I humbly consider this new discourse to be true.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">I merely respond to your question,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">hoping for eventual enlightenment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-14a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">○ The following is also in the eighteenth volume of the "Guǎng Hóngmíng Jí."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:05:47.436+09:00">&lt;Reply to Fǎ Xù's Questions&gt;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Fǎ Xù asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">"Having respectfully read your insightful discussion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">although clarifying the ultimate principle is subtle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">a single awakening brings complete understanding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">While I rejoice in the newly revealed explanation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">I still have some doubts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Clear-sighted individuals use understanding of principle to sever desires,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">while the complacent become entangled in burdens due to delusion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Severing desires originates from seeing the principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">while entanglement arises from deviating from the source.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Why do I say this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">The sutra says that new learners who are separated from prajna (wisdom)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">are like the blind without a guide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Thus, embracing principle eradicates suffering,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">which is clearly demonstrated here.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">If one's pursuit has not yet gradually approached the great source,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">and aspirations are still burdened by worldly defilements,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">then endless eons of toil</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">will lead to a distant and uncertain fruition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Since I harbor doubts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-15a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">I humbly await your esteemed instruction."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">The first reply:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">"The path is contrary to the mundane,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">principle is unrelated to the worldly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">therefore expedient means are used to make them accessible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">Although expedient means are provisional,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T15:08:34.994+09:00">their purpose lies in the non-provisional.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">Although wisdom is genuine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">its ability can be unreal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">The unreal does not harm the genuine;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">its essence lies in benefiting beings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">The unreal does not follow falsity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">benefiting beings leads back to the essence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">Such a calamity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">is a futile effort,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">hoping for a result like the shining sun.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">Xù asked again:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">According to the argument,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">the Dao of Confucius and Buddhism are the same,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">saving beings from falsity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">also should not be different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">But the realm of the divine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">even if wise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">is what Confucius did not teach;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">the subtlety of true reality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">even if foolish,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">is what the Shakya clan (Buddhists) must teach.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">Then, the teachings of the two sages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-17a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">why are they so contradictory?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">I answered again:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">The difference between the two teachings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">lies in adapting to the region and responding to things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:00:11.528+09:00">the land where they are transformed is different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">To greatly examine them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">the Huá Mín (華民, Chinese people) are quick to grasp principles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">but slow to accept instruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Therefore, close off their accumulated learning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">and open up their understanding of the ultimate principle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">The Yí Rén (夷人, foreign people) are quick to accept instruction,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">but slow to grasp principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Therefore, close off their sudden understanding</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">and open up their gradual enlightenment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Although gradual enlightenment can be achieved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">they are ignorant of the reality of sudden understanding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Although the ultimate principle is known to be relied upon,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">the hope of accumulated learning is cut off.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">This is because the Huá Rén (華人, Chinese people) understand principles without gradualism,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">and dismiss the Dao as needing no learning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">The Yí Rén (夷人, foreign people) understand principles through learning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">and dismiss the Dao as being gradual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Therefore, although expediency and reality are the same,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">their application differs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">In the past, Xiàng Zǐqī (向子期) considered Confucianism and Daoism to be one,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Yīng Jífǔ (應吉甫) said that Confucius and Laozi could be equated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">all wanting to perceive the source,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-18a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-06-20T16:58:41.445+09:00">how much more so those who have attained the truth!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Xù (勖) asked three times:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">Zhòng (重) replied,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">that because Huá (華, Chinese) and Yí (夷, foreign) people have natures that make things difficult or easy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:22:34.29+09:00">the two sages (Confucius and Laozi) dispensed different and similar teachings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Zhòng Fāng's adherence to custom</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">can be considered beautiful!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">However, if the profoundly clear sees</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">and sets an example from above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">the foolish and ignorant people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">submit and follow from below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Therefore, setting an example should carefully consider the policies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">and submission must affirm its principles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">If you command to abandon the path of Confucian sage-learning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">and释 (Shì, Buddhism) open a gradual enlightenment path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">with traps and footprints already in confusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-19a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">how can the common people return to the truth?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Third Response:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Winter and summer have different natures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">relying on spring and autumn as the beginning and end;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">day and night have distinct uses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">depending on morning and evening for recurrence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Moreover, how can the principle of utmost refinement</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">be directly connected to people of utmost coarseness?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Therefore, following gradual enlightenment</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">is how to secretly create sudden understanding;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">relying on Confucian teachings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">is how to silently achieve sage-learning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Sage-learning does not go beyond the Six Classics,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">and is attained through the Six Classics;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">sudden understanding is not found in the Three Treasures (Tripiṭaka),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">but is the fruit of the Three Treasures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">The traps and footprints are clear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">why doubt their confusion!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">Once the fish and rabbit are caught,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-20a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">the common people are saved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-21a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1585_CHANT_004-21a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-20T16:23:25.805+09:00">&lt;Reply to Monk Wéi's Question&gt;</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
